        'Figure 1: The one-page diagram showing how the retriever (query encoder + document index) feeds passages into the BART generator, and how the two are trained jointly.',
        'Table 1: The head-to-head scores on four open-domain QA benchmarks, where RAG-Sequence outperforms both extractive and parametric-only baselines.',
        'Section 4.5 (Index hot-swapping): The experiment where swapping a 2016 Wikipedia index for a 2018 one changes answers about world leaders without any retraining.',
      ],
