            'Extra small decoding heads on top of the model',
            'A separate smaller draft model',
            'Additional transformer layers in the middle',
            'A larger vocabulary',
          ],
          0,
          'Medusa heads are single-layer feed-forward networks appended to the last hidden states, not a separate model.',
        ),
        QuizQuestion(
          'Why is standard auto-regressive decoding a bottleneck?',
          [
